cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulation, please cite the paper it supports."
title: "ota-gating-sim: within-window atomic completion model for OTA update delivery"
abstract: >-
  Monte Carlo and replay model of over-the-air update delivery to autonomous
  devices that alternate between operating in public space and sitting
  stationary where they can install. Completion requires a single stationary
  window long enough to transfer and install atomically. Version 4 drives the
  model with measured inputs: dock windows from police drone flight logs, stop
  windows from Chicago taxi trips, Ookla link rates and Cabspotting contacts.
type: software
license: MIT
version: "4.0"
date-released: "2026-10-16"

